From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: psigod <psigod@example.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 19:19:55 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: codecs: add Richtek RT5508 speaker amplifier driver

Add a driver for the Richtek RT5508 mono smart amplifier, based on the
vendor driver in Samsung's MSM8996 kernels: register map with per-register
widths, the vendor initial settings per chip revision, the temperature
coefficient from OTP, boost bypass above 4.7 V VBAT, and the vendor power
sequences as DAPM events. I2S and 4-slot TDM with 16, 24 or 32 bit slots;
the slot pair and channel come from firmware or from set_tdm_slot().

Playback only: the factory calibration and the speaker protection and
EQ/DRC parameter sets the vendor driver takes from user space are left
out.

Tested on a Samsung Galaxy Tab S3 (APQ8096), four amplifiers on two TDM
buses.

Signed-off-by: psigod <psigod@example.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 sound/soc/codecs/Kconfig  |   12 +
 sound/soc/codecs/Makefile |    2 +
 sound/soc/codecs/rt5508.c | 1127 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 1141 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 sound/soc/codecs/rt5508.c

